    {
      "text": "SCHUR–WEYL DUALITY IN POSITIVE CHARACTERISTIC — Complete proofs of Schur–Weyl duality in positive characteristic are scarce in the literature.\n\n**SCHUR–WEYL DUALITY IN POSITIVE CHARACTERISTIC**\n\n*STEPHEN DOTY*\n\n17 pp, 5 sections.\n\n**Abstract.** Complete proofs of Schur–Weyl duality in positive characteristic are scarce in the literature. The purpose of this sur- vey is to write out the details of such a proof, deriving the result in positive characteristic from the classical result in characteristic zero, using only known facts from representation theory.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 Introduction; 2 Surjectivity of; 3 Surjectivity of; References",
